# Copy this file to `.env` in this same folder, then replace the placeholder
# below with your monday personal API token.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Get the token: monday.com -> your avatar (bottom-left) -> Developers ->
# My Access Tokens.
#
# Rules the parser cares about (server.js line 25):
#   - the line must start with MONDAY_API_TOKEN
#   - one `=` separates key and value
#   - NO quotes, NO spaces around the value, nothing after it
#   - the token is one long single line; do not wrap it
#
# `.env` is gitignored. `.env.example` is safe to commit because it holds no
# real value. Never put the token in any other file.

MONDAY_API_TOKEN=paste_your_token_here
